      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4A7Nmi",
      "body": "I opened one up and it looks like it uses Sequans SQN3241. The SQN3241 is an LTE baseband modem + RF transceiver. Importantly not a Qualcomm modem, the Rayhunter supported devices page says \"Theoretically, if a device runs a Qualcomm modem and exposes a /dev/diag interface, Rayhunter may work on it.\"\r\nI would say support won't be added soon, if ever. \r\nCrossing fingers I'm wrong!",
      "author": {
        "login": "monkz0390",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12043783?v=4",
        "url": "https://github.com/monkz0390"
